{"id":"591395654","kind":"article","title":"赋能环境的重点是创造成长和行动的机会，而不是技能培养","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5th5bWm6VhB6PPbYB97gUKMdnaZe5atntRza"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-12-13","updated":"2024-05-18","votes":8,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":889,"keywords":["赋能环境","实践学习","内在动机","知识工作","学习设计","行动机会"],"summary":"译文认为，赋能环境的目标应是创造成长和实际行动的机会，而非单纯训练技能。以研究所或 Y Combinator 为例，参与者在追求内在有意义的项目时，个人成长是项目的副产品；作者据此质疑把书籍等媒介仅视为抽象知识传递工具，并提出能否设计出把知识与行动相连的“书”。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/591395654","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"d-45qCW1\">卓越的研究所不会执着于给它的研究生灌输大量专业知识和技能。 它通过为个人成长提供大量机会，并在上述成长的基础上强调为<b>行动</b>的机会缔造纽带。这对于建立有效的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3DaBP4vN1dutjUgrk3jbEeNxScccvDCxDgXe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">赋能环境</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>来说大体上是正确的。</p><p data-pid=\"BI1roaIn\">不得不说的是，像这样的环境并不会为了成长而促进成长。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2kQbKXThuY4FrdXVcE7JCt974sPATVhSpita\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Y Combinator</a> 的创始人主要致力于缔造一家成功的公司，而不是实现个人成长（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7wh92mfgXNTLk8AhaaLxsViQuzqGY5cV56Vm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">赋能环境中的活动直接服务于有内在意义的目的</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>）。并且到了环境创造个人成长的地步，与其关注「练习」，不如强调所有事情的终极目标（例如让新公司风生水起）。</p><p data-pid=\"igA7CRUq\">这启发给我们以新的眼光审视现存的媒介。例如，书籍很少侧重于为个人成长或行动提供机会：它们通常是在一个抽象的背景下传达知识。这引出了一个扣人心弦的启示：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"shbj5OnG\">那么，撰写「书籍」，其主要关于给人们创造成长机会，和在该成长的基础上通向行动机会的纽带，这意味着什么？</blockquote><p data-pid=\"K74735Gs\">参见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zVdb1Ku6fzVAFP5A6BhBbWR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">摩尔教学法</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。</p><hr/><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参考文献</h3><p data-pid=\"VwYbWPbt\">与迈克尔·尼尔森的对话，2019-12-10</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"PmKziPbh\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"698476935\" href=\"#/post/698476935\">§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》</a></li><li data-pid=\"TqGFgoyb\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458337989\" href=\"#/post/458337989\">赋能环境</a></li><li data-pid=\"I232kx8t\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"482949294\" href=\"#/post/482949294\">赋能环境中的活动直接服务于有内在意义的目的</a></li><li data-pid=\"X8s4H-rW\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"487188240\" href=\"#/post/487188240\">赋能环境重在推动所赋能的事</a></li><li data-pid=\"2jWIj8g2\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"448382399\" href=\"#/post/448382399\">教育计划往往会自我颠覆</a></li><li data-pid=\"xSoRw-uM\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"449283714\" href=\"#/post/449283714\">间隔重复系统的主流文化圈热衷无意义的目标</a></li><li data-pid=\"UWYzFMQS\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"466828742\" href=\"#/post/466828742\">间隔重复记忆系统可以缩短科目学习中不愉快的早期阶段</a></li><li data-pid=\"9IlOlyJk\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"597534858\" href=\"#/post/597534858\">思想工具应该在有内在意义的目的的上下文中进行评估</a></li><li data-pid=\"ULqdFj-t\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"599592073\" href=\"#/post/599592073\">助记媒介应该基于即用即学的场景开发，而不要基于预备学习的场景开发</a></li><li data-pid=\"3FOqDN73\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"603115527\" href=\"#/post/603115527\">知识工作很少涉及刻意练习</a></li><li data-pid=\"v9lZEevz\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"591395654\" href=\"#/post/591395654\">赋能环境的重点是创造成长和行动的机会，而不是技能培养</a></li><li data-pid=\"Nu8vERNu\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"694282984\" href=\"#/post/694282984\">Y Combinator</a></li><li data-pid=\"LSkdwtvw\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"695746771\" href=\"#/post/695746771\">《启蒙琼林》并不是一个可行的赋能环境</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"KK6pepvU\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 lost-in-mind<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5th5bWm6VhB6PPbYB97gUKMdnaZe5atntRza\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Enabling environments focus on creating opportunities for growth and action, not on skill-building (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 赋能环境 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458337989\" href=\"#/post/458337989\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 赋能环境中的活动直接服务于有内在意义的目的 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"482949294\" href=\"#/post/482949294\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 摩尔教学法 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"662762042\" href=\"#/post/662762042\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"590058669","title":"从哪些角度看，助记媒介不仅仅是普通文章上面的注解层？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":3,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"596146543","title":"Orbit - 价值观","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"694282984","title":"Y Combinator","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"698476935","title":"§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"695746771","title":"《启蒙琼林》并不是一个可行的赋能环境","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3225403127","title":"为什么游戏设计师可以设计出让人上瘾的游戏，而教育设计师设计让人上瘾的学习比较少?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":173,"minutes":11,"reason":"观点化用 · 173 赞同","evidence":"回答在正文中用自己的话呈现《赋能环境的重点是创造成长和行动的机会，而不是技能培养》的特异观点；目标译文正文提供对应论证。"}]}